<view class="page"><view class="panel"><text class="title">数据看板</text><text class="sub">PawPal 本周经营概览</text><view class="kpi-grid"><view class="kpi"><text class="kpi-v">{{shop.metrics.visitors}}</text><text class="kpi-k">周访客</text></view><view class="kpi"><text class="kpi-v">{{shop.metrics.conversion}}%</text><text class="kpi-k">转化率</text></view><view class="kpi"><text class="kpi-v">${{shop.metrics.sales}}</text><text class="kpi-k">销售额</text></view><view class="kpi"><text class="kpi-v">{{shop.metrics.acos}}%</text><text class="kpi-k">ACOS</text></view><view class="kpi"><text class="kpi-v">{{shop.metrics.stockDays}}天</text><text class="kpi-k">库存水位</text></view><view class="kpi"><text class="kpi-v">{{shop.metrics.rating}}</text><text class="kpi-k">店铺评分</text></view></view><text class="review">建议：库存水位和 ACOS 需要优先关注，进入对应模块执行操作。</text><button bindtap="onBack">返回店铺</button></view></view>